    {
      "id": "allocate-at",
      "name": "AllocateAt",
      "category": "RefCountVector",
      "signature": "AllocateAt(Target, Index)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FRefCountVector*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Index",
          "type": "Int"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "allocate at specific Index, which must either be larger than current max Index,\nor on the free list. If larger, all elements up to this one will be pushed onto\nfree list. otherwise we have to do a linear search through free list.\nIf you are doing many of these, it is likely faster to use\nAllocateAtUnsafe(), and then RebuildFreeList() after you are done."
    },
